Package: scaleLLMflow
Type: Package
Title: General LLM Workflows for Scientific Quality Scales
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Proyecto MQS", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.com")
  )
Author: Proyecto MQS
Maintainer: Proyecto MQS <noreply@example.com>
Description: Provides reusable functions to register prompts by scale and model,
    resolve the best available prompt for a requested AI model, extract PDF text,
    call user-configured LLM APIs, and parse scale item scores. The first bundled
    scale is MQS with the consolidated v019 Gemini prompt.
